Subject: [PATCH] tty: declare exp_tty_cooked_echo in the internal interface

exp_main_sub.c calls this existing function through exp_tty_in.h. Supply
the matching prototype so newer compilers can check its arguments without
an implicit function declaration.

--- a/exp_tty.h
+++ b/exp_tty.h
@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@
 void exp_tty_echo(int set);
 void exp_tty_break(Tcl_Interp *interp, int fd);
 int exp_tty_raw_noecho(Tcl_Interp *interp, exp_tty *tty_old, int *was_raw, int *was_echo);
+int exp_tty_cooked_echo(Tcl_Interp *interp, exp_tty *tty_old, int *was_raw, int *was_echo);
 int exp_israw(void);
 int exp_isecho(void);
 
